    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/178582e5f04c19c9b04bf7e78e74de12.avif?t=1741612415\" width=320 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kingdom in ruin. A world in decay. Steel and skill are your only hope to unravel the secrets of this classic Metroidvania adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong><br> In this 2D sidescrolling action-adventure, explore a sprawling, interconnected world sliding into ruin, where every shadow hides danger and every path conceals a secret. Armed with steel and determination, you\u2019ll battle relentless foes, uncover forgotten lore, and forge not only your own destiny, but the destiny of a kingdom gripped by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced 2D combat, uncover hidden paths, and test your skill in a classic Metroidvania adventure.\u00a0 This journey will test your skill, wit, and resolve. Will you restore order, embrace the chaos, or forge a path all your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/1b8afdff3399abeb8c99fdfc0c045da1.poster.avif?t=1741612415\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/1b8afdff3399abeb8c99fdfc0c045da1.webm?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/1b8afdff3399abeb8c99fdfc0c045da1.mp4?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat System</strong>: Master <strong>precise, fluid, and challenging combat</strong> to take on a diverse array of enemies, from corrupted knights to monstrous beasts. Dash, dodge, and strike with perfect timing to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong>: Wield <strong>swords, spears, whips, and more</strong>, each with unique moves and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive, Interconnected World</strong>: A vast, <strong>hand-crafted</strong> realm filled with secrets, shortcuts, and hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression</strong>: Upgrade skills, <strong>equip powerful gear</strong>, and shape your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable Boss Fights</strong>: Test your mettle against powerful foes in <strong>25+ epic boss encounters</strong> that require strategy, skill, and mastery of your abilities to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery</strong>: Uncover the truth behind the kingdom\u2019s collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for an unforgettable adventure</strong> where danger lurks in every shadow, and only the bold can uncover the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/003187956ba6f558fc144298814fedc9.poster.avif?t=1741612415\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/003187956ba6f558fc144298814fedc9.webm?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/003187956ba6f558fc144298814fedc9.mp4?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/178582e5f04c19c9b04bf7e78e74de12.avif?t=1741612415\" width=320 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kingdom in ruin. A world in decay. Steel and skill are your only hope to unravel the secrets of this classic Metroidvania adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong><br> In this 2D sidescrolling action-adventure, explore a sprawling, interconnected world sliding into ruin, where every shadow hides danger and every path conceals a secret. Armed with steel and determination, you\u2019ll battle relentless foes, uncover forgotten lore, and forge not only your own destiny, but the destiny of a kingdom gripped by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced 2D combat, uncover hidden paths, and test your skill in a classic Metroidvania adventure.\u00a0 This journey will test your skill, wit, and resolve. Will you restore order, embrace the chaos, or forge a path all your own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/1b8afdff3399abeb8c99fdfc0c045da1.poster.avif?t=1741612415\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/1b8afdff3399abeb8c99fdfc0c045da1.webm?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/1b8afdff3399abeb8c99fdfc0c045da1.mp4?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat System</strong>: Master <strong>precise, fluid, and challenging combat</strong> to take on a diverse array of enemies, from corrupted knights to monstrous beasts. Dash, dodge, and strike with perfect timing to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong>: Wield <strong>swords, spears, whips, and more</strong>, each with unique moves and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive, Interconnected World</strong>: A vast, <strong>hand-crafted</strong> realm filled with secrets, shortcuts, and hidden paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression</strong>: Upgrade skills, <strong>equip powerful gear</strong>, and shape your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable Boss Fights</strong>: Test your mettle against powerful foes in <strong>25+ epic boss encounters</strong> that require strategy, skill, and mastery of your abilities to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery</strong>: Uncover the truth behind the kingdom\u2019s collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for an unforgettable adventure</strong> where danger lurks in every shadow, and only the bold can uncover the truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/003187956ba6f558fc144298814fedc9.poster.avif?t=1741612415\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/003187956ba6f558fc144298814fedc9.webm?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419620/extras/003187956ba6f558fc144298814fedc9.mp4?t=1741612415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
